{1008}{497l  May the gods have mercy upon us.}

{1009}{497l Please revenge us}


{1010}{497l  You must find the 7 books of wisdom traveller .Every book will grant you some expirience but on the 5,6, and 7 book the gods shall grant you a substansial expirience bonus}

